{"synced":[{"time":11.47,"text":"Lovers say that in France"},{"time":15.55,"text":"When they thrill to romance"},{"time":19.91,"text":"It means that it's so good"},{"time":24.11,"text":"Ah c'est si bon"},{"time":28.23,"text":"So I say it to you"},{"time":32.44,"text":"Like the French people do"},{"time":36.62,"text":"Because it's oh so good"},{"time":41.88,"text":"Every word every sigh every kiss dear"},{"time":49.95,"text":"Leads to only one thought and it's this dear"},{"time":58.06,"text":"Oh it's ah so good"},{"time":62,"text":"Nothing else can replace"},{"time":66.11,"text":"Just your slightest embrace"},{"time":70.38,"text":"And if you only would"},{"time":75.22,"text":"Be my own for the rest of my days"},{"time":83.07,"text":"I will whisper this phrase"},{"time":86.84,"text":"My darling c'est si bon"}],"plain":null}